  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2308.03 Sanitization. Dishes, utensils, and food contact equipment and surfaces shall undergo sanitization as required in Food Code 4-703.11, except that sanitization, if done in the 2 compartment sink, shall occur in the second compartment after the dishes, utensils, and food contact equipment have been rinsed with clean water.\n\nSource. #6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11, EXPIRED: 2-1-19\n\nNew. #12729, INTERIM, eff 2-21-19, EXPIRES: 8-20-19; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19",
